# v1.143: float-TIFF integration audit/CLI contract fix only.
# v1.142 successfully reached card loading and float-TIFF parsing, but the
# startup audit return schema had been changed while its caller still expected
# the v1.139 keys (dose_formula, height_formula, etc.), causing a KeyError.
