# v1.130: retain v1.129 complete-carrier/same-layer-infill mechanics; make the direct-layer CLI geometry contract accurately describe all-carrier scheduler mode instead of the legacy normal-chromatic Z-offset path.
# This enables the repeating-layer test: ordinary W carrier on logical layer 1, then chromatic
