        "3dprintv1.55: adds compact --audit. Default generation skips the four expensive late full-stream checks: first-layer acceleration, cleaned-stream strict parsing, cleaned-stream raw-tool coverage, and post-M73 packaged-stream strict parsing. The small inherited-template provenance, classification, typed-label, and rendered-fragment checks remain mandatory.",
